{"name": "Jolt: Neon Breaker", "description": "<div class=\"game_area_description\" id=\"game_area_description\">\n<h2>About This Game</h2>\n<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Take control of the ball in a modern evolution of the classic brick breaker formula.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Jolt: Neon Breaker</strong> combines precise arcade action with explosive progression systems, letting you <strong>smash through Bricks</strong>, trigger chain reactions, and build increasingly frantic setups where every bounce matters. Use momentum, timing, and the <strong>Jolt ability</strong> to shape each shot and push destruction further with every run. <br/><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"100\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3985100/extras/c2f4df8379d62485d357557f6e231894.avif?t=1782509796\" width=\"800\"/></span>Phase through Bricks, deploy multi-balls, ... Unleash your Abilities to <strong>bend the rules of physics</strong> and vaporize entire waves of Bricks in seconds. Each Ability can be upgraded permanently and during Stages.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"448\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3985100/extras/675831627d2aea949bf517f705e03f19.poster.avif?t=1782509796\" width=\"800\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3985100/extras/675831627d2aea949bf517f705e03f19.webm?t=1782509796\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3985100/extras/675831627d2aea949bf517f705e03f19.mp4?t=1782509796\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"100\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3985100/extras/6ae8f38c970d88341cd9e24d8fbd46c8.avif?t=1782509796\" width=\"800\"/></span>Equip passive damage-dealing Gadgets to support your <strong>Brick-crushing mayhem</strong> with fire, electricity and acid.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"424\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3985100/extras/dc96ac8bfe42df3bf940590abb65fd87.poster.avif?t=1782509796\" width=\"800\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3985100/extras/dc96ac8bfe42df3bf940590abb65fd87.webm?t=1782509796\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3985100/extras/dc96ac8bfe42df3bf940590abb65fd87.mp4?t=1782509796\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"100\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3985100/extras/1cc500165e286e329193410447809ef2.avif?t=1782509796\" width=\"800\"/></span><u><strong> </strong></u> <br/>Between Stages, you invest  to upgrade the Ball, making it faster, stronger, and more destructive. As the invasion intensifies, you\u2019ll unlock new Abilities and Gadgets that completely change how you play, from precision control to <strong>screen-clearing blasts</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"464\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3985100/extras/f4052184c69b5b0ea07029b39f21c96f.poster.avif?t=1782509796\" width=\"958\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3985100/extras/f4052184c69b5b0ea07029b39f21c96f.webm?t=1782509796\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3985100/extras/f4052184c69b5b0ea07029b39f21c96f.mp4?t=1782509796\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"100\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3985100/extras/38aade1686a1159b7fd3c05fadec6bdf.avif?t=1782509796\" width=\"800\"/></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Battle through <strong>28 Stages</strong>\u00a0against a relentless Brick invasion.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Master <strong>4 unique Abilities</strong> and unleash unmitigated destruction</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Equip <strong>6 powerful Gadgets</strong> to support your Brick-crushing mayhem.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Choose from <strong>100+ upgrades</strong>, from simple stat boosts to game-changing effects, and craft your <strong>perfect build</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Put your skills and builds to the test in <strong>Hard Mode</strong>. <br/> <br/> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>DESTROY ALL THE BRICKS!</strong></p></li></ul> </div>", "short_desc": "Take direct control of the ball in this high-speed neon brick breaker. Upgrade your capacities, unleash devastating abilities, and smash through waves of bricks in this hypnotic arcade experience!", "header_image": "https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3985100/d41417d047bbd6c3944df21bddf430d4ba40ece1/header.jpg?t=1782509796", "screenshots": [], "tags": ["Arcade", "Roguelike", "Fast-Paced", "Destruction", "Bullet Hell", "Action"], "developers": "Kawobi Games", "publishers": "Kawobi Games", "release_date": "Jun 23, 2026", "price": "$7.99", "appid": "3985100", "review_type": "Informational", "curator_desc": "23 June 2026 - Demo", "yt_link": "https://youtu.be/vX5Pr6L6IK8", "first_seen": 1787672317.555697}